      "en_US": [
        "Sigh... I opened a branch here,\\n",
        "but I can’t sell my Bicycles.\\f",
        "Why is that?\\r",
        "Could you ride a Bicycle and\\n",
        "advertise for me? {YESNO, 0, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Really? Great!\\r",
        "Give me your name and phone number,\\n",
        "and I’ll loan you a Bicycle. {YESNO, 0, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_00002",
      "en_US": "                  "
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0584_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "The main shop is at Cerulean\\n",
